<git_bash_file_link_instructions>
## Windows Git Bash file links
Use Git Bash paths such as `/c/...` in commands and structured tool path arguments. For Markdown links to local files in your response, use native Windows absolute paths with forward slashes, such as `C:/...`, in the link destination. Codex App opens local file links using native Windows paths, so do not use Git Bash `/c/...` paths in Markdown link destinations. A Git Bash path `/c/work/file.rs` maps to `C:/work/file.rs`.
</git_bash_file_link_instructions>

